# a2a-demo specialist (A2A .NET SDK 1.0.0-preview2, A2A v1.0 JSON-RPC binding).
# Start (from this folder): dotnet run specialist.cs
@host = http://localhost:5062

### Server info
GET {{host}}/

### Well-known agent card
GET {{host}}/.well-known/agent-card.json

### A2A JSON-RPC SendMessage (v1.0: method "SendMessage", role "ROLE_USER")
POST {{host}}/a2a/specialist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "SendMessage",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "messageId": "local-client-1",
      "role": "ROLE_USER",
      "parts": [
        { "text": "hello specialist" }
      ]
    }
  }
}
